voiceyt - third-party components and licences
=============================================

This file records the licences of everything voiceyt bundles or downloads, so the
obligations of each are clear.

1. Vendored code: voiceyt/vendor/nemotron_onnx_streaming.py
-----------------------------------------------------------
   Upstream : https://github.com/codavidgarcia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-onnx
              (engine/nemotron_onnx_streaming.py)
   Licence  : Apache-2.0 (see voiceyt/vendor/LICENSE-nemotron-onnx-engine)
